sequenceDiagram
    participant frontend
    participant gc-signin-ibm (backend)
    participant ibm verify api
    frontend->>gc-signin-ibm (backend): user's OIDC code sent to backend's login endpoint   
    gc-signin-ibm (backend)->>ibm verify api: makes request for fresh jwt
    ibm verify api->>gc-signin-ibm (backend): login response
    gc-signin-ibm (backend)->>frontend: forwards login response to enduser